          "_name": "header09",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "```html\n<style>\n/* =========================================\n   CY ROBINSON TECHNOLOGIES\n   DIGITAL RADIO APPLICATION PAGE\n   GREEN THEME\n========================================= */\n\n.cyr-radio-page {\n    background: #0B120D !important;\n    color: #F4F5FA;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-page * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-page a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-wrap {\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 1220px;\n    margin: auto;\n}\n\n/* HERO */\n\n.cyr-radio-hero {\n    min-height: 590px;\n    padding: 115px 0 100px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    position: relative;\n    background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 25%, rgba(183,230,92,.15), transparent 40%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 90%, rgba(90,145,65,.12), transparent 38%),\n        #0B120D !important;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-hero:before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 420px;\n    height: 420px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(197,237,121,.10);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    right: -150px;\n    top: 50px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: auto;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-eyebrow {\n    color: #B7E65C;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-title {\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 64px;\n    line-height: 1.08;\n    letter-spacing: -3px;\n    margin: 25px 0;\n    font-weight: 750;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-gradient {\n    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #C5ED79, #8FC65A, #D8F29B);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    background-clip: text;\n    color: transparent;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-description {\n    max-width: 680px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    color: #B5C0B0;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-button {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-top: 38px;\n    padding: 17px 30px;\n    color: #14200F !important;\n    background: linear-gradient(110deg, #A6D84D, #D0EF78);\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(166,216,77,.16);\n    transition: .3s ease;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-button:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(166,216,77,.28);\n}\n\n/* INTRODUCTION */\n\n.cyr-radio-info {\n    padding: 85px 0;\n    background: #111A13 !important;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(197,237,121,.08);\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-info-inner {\n    max-width: 850px;\n    margin: auto;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-info h2 {\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 38px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -1.5px;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-info p {\n    color: #B5C0B0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* USE CASES */\n\n.cyr-radio-uses {\n    padding: 90px 0;\n    background: #0B120D !important;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-uses-heading {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto 45px;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-uses-heading h2 {\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 38px;\n    letter-spacing: -1.5px;\n    margin: 18px 0;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-uses-heading p {\n    color: #B5C0B0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-use-grid {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-use-card {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 35px 30px;\n    background: linear-gradient(140deg, #1A281D, #111A13) !important;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(183,230,92,.13);\n    transition: .3s ease;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-use-card:hover {\n    border-color: rgba(183,230,92,.32);\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-use-number {\n    color: #B7E65C;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-use-card h3 {\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 23px;\n    margin: 25px 0 12px;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-use-card p {\n    color: #B5C0B0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* CONTACT CTA */\n\n.cyr-radio-contact {\n    padding: 90px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 100%, rgba(120,165,65,.20), transparent 55%),\n        linear-gradient(130deg, #162218, #0D160F) !important;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-contact-inner {\n    max-width: 750px;\n    margin: auto;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-contact h2 {\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    letter-spacing: -1.5px;\n    margin: 18px 0;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-contact p {\n    color: #B5C0B0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    max-width: 580px;\n    margin: auto;\n}\n\n/* FOOTER */\n\n.cyr-radio-footer {\n    padding: 30px 0;\n    background: #080E09 !important;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(197,237,121,.09);\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-footer-inner {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 15px;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-footer strong {\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.cyr-radio-footer p {\n    color: #899486;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* RESPONSIVE */\n\n@media (max-width: 700px) {\n    .cyr-radio-hero {\n        min-height: 480px;\n        padding: 85px 0 75px;\n    }\n\n    .cyr-radio-title {\n        font-size: 43px;\n        letter-spacing: -2px;\n    }\n\n    .cyr-radio-description {\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .cyr-radio-info,\n    .cyr-radio-uses {\n        padding: 65px 0;\n    }\n\n    .cyr-radio-info h2,\n    .cyr-radio-uses-heading h2 {\n        font-size: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .cyr-radio-use-grid {\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n\n    .cyr-radio-contact {\n        padding: 70px 0;\n    }\n\n    .cyr-radio-contact h2 {\n        font-size: 32px;\n    }\n\n    .cyr-radio-footer-inner {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"cyr-radio-page\">\n\n    <!-- HERO -->\n    <section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"cyr-radio-hero\">\n        <div class=\"cyr-radio-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"cyr-radio-content\">\n\n                <span class=\"cyr-radio-eyebrow\">\n                    A DIGITAL APPLICATION BY CY ROBINSON TECHNOLOGIES\n                </span>\n\n                <h1 class=\"cyr-radio-title\">\n                    Broadcasting and Podcasting,\n                    <span class=\"cyr-radio-gradient\">\n                        Made Digital.\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"cyr-radio-description\">\n                    Discover a digital radio application developed to\n                    support broadcasting and podcasting. Whether you\n                    are interested in sharing programmes, creating\n                    audio content or exploring digital broadcasting,\n                    this application offers a practical platform to consider.\n                </p>\n\n                <a href=\"contact.html\" class=\"cyr-radio-button\">\n                    INQUIRE MORE &nbsp; ↗\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- INTRODUCTION -->\n    <section class=\"cyr-radio-info\">\n        <div class=\"cyr-radio-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"cyr-radio-info-inner\">\n\n                <span class=\"cyr-radio-eyebrow\">\n                    ABOUT THE APPLICATION\n                </span>\n\n                <h2>\n                    A digital platform for\n                    <span class=\"cyr-radio-gradient\">\n                        sharing audio content.\n                    </span>\n                </h2>\n\n                <p>\n                    Digital Radio is an application developed with\n                    broadcasting and podcasting in mind. It provides\n                    a digital approach to audio content, offering an\n                    opportunity for broadcasters and podcasters to\n                    explore new ways of sharing their programmes\n                    and reaching listeners.\n                </p>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- USE CASES -->\n    <section class=\"cyr-radio-uses\">\n        <div class=\"cyr-radio-wrap\">\n\n            <div class=\"cyr-radio-uses-heading\">\n                <span class=\"cyr-radio-eyebrow\">\n                    WHAT IT IS FOR\n                </span>\n\n                <h2>\n                    Created with broadcasting\n                    <span class=\"cyr-radio-gradient\">\n                        and podcasting in mind.\n                    </span>\n                </h2>\n\n                <p>\n                    A digital application with potential uses across\n                    different forms of audio content and broadcasting.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"cyr-radio-use-grid\">\n\n                <div class=\"cyr-radio-use-card\">\n                    <span class=\"cyr-radio-use-number\">01 / BROADCASTING</span>\n\n                    <h3>Digital Broadcasting</h3>\n\n                    <p>\n                        Explore a digital approach to broadcasting\n                        programmes and sharing audio content with\n                        an audience.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"cyr-radio-use-card\">\n                    <span class=\"cyr-radio-use-number\">02 / PODCASTING</span>\n\n                    <h3>Podcasting</h3>\n\n                    <p>\n                        A platform to consider for podcast creators\n                        and anyone interested in producing and\n                        sharing audio programmes.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- CONTACT CTA -->\n    <section class=\"cyr-radio-contact\">\n        <div class=\"cyr-radio-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"cyr-radio-contact-inner\">\n\n                <span class=\"cyr-radio-eyebrow\">\n                    WANT TO KNOW MORE?\n                </span>\n\n                <h2>\n                    Interested in Digital Radio?\n                </h2>\n\n                <p>\n                    Have questions about the application or want\n                    to make an enquiry? Get in touch with us\n                    to find out more.\n                </p>\n\n                <a href=\"contact.html\" class=\"cyr-radio-button\">\n                    INQUIRE MORE &nbsp; ↗\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\n    <footer class=\"cyr-radio-footer\">\n        <div class=\"cyr-radio-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"cyr-radio-footer-inner\">\n\n                <strong>CY ROBINSON TECHNOLOGIES.</strong>\n\n                <p>\n                    © 2026 CY Robinson Technologies. All rights reserved.\n                </p>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n</div>\n```",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vzVGArpPlp",
